<description>&lt;p&gt;President Biya has finally announced a date for the long-delayed national elections, ending his prolonged absence from public view. Two Cameroonians serving in Russia’s army were reported killed, prompting the African Bar Association to call for mediation in the Anglophone crisis. The UN Human Rights Committee released findings on Cameroon while activist Agbor Balla warned that a decade of bloodshed still prevents children from safely returning to school in the conflict zones. A trans woman was attacked in Cameroon. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxOcXdLN3dvYlMwVUpIOF80bEVmVXdtTXMyRTFsMlRZNXk3U1BTZ3NzREtJMXhWcnNZTkNvZ3I3eVBZS0d4anFtSDZqaDFJMEQ4Mm83X25Fc3gzcF92RFdndTNxR3RRWWIweDJUajdMWUotVUx3a2FURW0yS0t4SXY0SFE2bHlBWC1naG9PX1phODVfbkFOcjd6UncxTVhYSTJUdnNSSUwyeXVqMm1Lekx0MU02MFQ3ZkJ5S0VISWV5UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE85VS1uZ2UzWVc3ZzRlNWdlazVPYi1jd2ZhT2lvM3VTYk5VWkVWQVhvR29mQjdqOGN3QVBwbmd6YmVOLW9aR19BejlZd1FRN21jcGZTNjFLaHVKNlRiMEdVbmdiSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNdkJIZGwtQWZzZ1FGRmJVVV9JaXQzcEh4ZXk1eGVPMjM4NVVqRGdFY2V2cVR3MDN5bTEyOVNLckQ5RUdJME9PTHdhaUZFODdrT2s1YUkxZHZTTVZ1OFA5M3lRUndPYm9HcERDNmtXME5GZTdFLURnUFpVd1NOVEtWZjB4RVA2ODFWRldNN0tMNi11UzA?oc=5&quot;&gt;SABC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE84WGdFdl9DamU0LVNwcE1PanpHOF9iQTd3SnhwN3J1U0x0enFVLW9jekJnVEJkcVd0RjN0WjBVWXM1cFVsWnJxU0pjRW5aSGZIaVNSM2d6M1VtN0NyM044WkxHcVhaWjA1aVpFeHlHN1RWR0wwZS1Z?oc=5&quot;&gt;Britannica&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;News24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/arti